        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9303, Smooth Dome Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Dome Cabinet Knob made by RK International is a great example of the beauty of simplicity. The curved top brings a feeling of movement to the knob which in turn makes it seem so elegant. It is available in 7 finishes. Choose from either the 1-1/4 inch diameter or the larger 1-1/2 inch diameter size.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9303 Simple Dome Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9303:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9304:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
